WEBVTT

00:13:29.379 --> 00:13:31.045
Nderkohe qe vajza ime

00:13:31.045 --> 00:13:34.497
ishte midis jetes e vdekjes,

00:13:34.497 --> 00:13:38.336
Une pershperita ne veshin e gruas time,

00:13:38.336 --> 00:13:41.438
" A duhet te fajsohem per çka i ndodhi

00:13:41.438 --> 00:13:45.114
vajzes time dhe vajzes tende?"

00:13:45.114 --> 00:13:47.635
E ajo befas me tha,

00:13:47.635 --> 00:13:50.146
"Mos e fajso veten.

00:13:50.146 --> 00:13:53.362
Ti qendrove per nje kauze te drejte.

00:13:53.362 --> 00:13:55.497
Vendose jeten tende ne rrezik

00:13:55.497 --> 00:13:56.900
per kauzen e te vertetes

00:13:56.900 --> 00:13:58.081
per kauzen e paqes,

00:13:58.081 --> 00:14:00.189
per kauzen e edukimit,